{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function getAll<T>(objectStore): Promise<T[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:341"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Retrieves all items from an object store."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Uses the native "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getAll()"},{"type":"text","value":" method for efficient bulk retrieval."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of items in the object store"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"objectstore","children":[{"type":"text","value":"objectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The IDBObjectStore to read from"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves to an array of all items in the store"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"await executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allTodos = await getAll<Todo>(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All todos:', allTodos)\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"objectstore","text":"objectStore","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction getAll<T>(objectStore): Promise<T[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:341\n\nRetrieves all items from an object store.\n\nUses the native `getAll()` method for efficient bulk retrieval.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of items in the object store\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read from\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`T`[]\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of all items in the store\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allTodos = await getAll<Todo>(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All todos:', allTodos)\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: getAll\ntitle: getAll\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction getAll<T>(objectStore): Promise<T[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:341\n\nRetrieves all items from an object store.\n\nUses the native `getAll()` method for efficient bulk retrieval.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of items in the object store\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read from\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`T`[]\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of all items in the store\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allTodos = await getAll<Todo>(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All todos:', allTodos)\n})\n```\n"}
